
============================================================================================
0) Frozen n=5 EOS anchor
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[1] P{\left(\rho \right)} = K \rho^{5}

[2] c^{2}_{s}{\left(\rho \right)} = 5 K \rho^{4}

[3] h{\left(\rho \right)} = \frac{5 K \rho^{4}}{4}

[4] U{\left(\rho \right)} = \frac{K \rho^{5}}{4}

[5] \rho\,h'(\rho) = 5 K \rho^{4}

============================================================================================


============================================================================================
1) Canonical gauged 4D GNLS form (compact)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
i \bar{\h} \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial t} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q A_{0}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) = - \frac{\bar{\h}^{2} \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial w^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial x^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial y^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial z^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right)}{2 m} + \left(\frac{5 K \bar\psi^{4}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi^{4}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{4} + V_{\rm conf}{\left(x,y,z,w,a,L \right)}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
2) Canonical 4D current definition (component-wise)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
J_{i} = - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- D_{i\bar\psi} \psi + D_{i\psi} \bar\psi\right)}{2 m}
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
3) 4D continuity identity: rho_t + div_4 J = 0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial w^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial w^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right)}{2 m} - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial x^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial x^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right)}{2 m} - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial y^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial y^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right)}{2 m} - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial z^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial z^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right)}{2 m} + \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial t} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial t} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} = 0
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
4) Brane projection weight: W(w)\ (unnormalized)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
W_{t} = W{\left(w \right)}
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
5–6) Brane observables (definitions)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[1] \rho_{\rm brane} = \int W\,\rho\,dw

[2] \mathbf J_{\rm brane} = \int W\,\mathbf J\,dw

============================================================================================


============================================================================================
7) Exact projected continuity: (rho_brane)_t + div_3(J_brane) = S_rho_brane
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
\int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial x^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial x^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial x} \operatorname{Ax}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right) W{\left(w \right)}}{2 m}\right)\, dw + \int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial y^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial y^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \operatorname{Ay}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right) W{\left(w \right)}}{2 m}\right)\, dw + \int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial z^{2}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} + \frac{i q \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial^{2}}{\partial z^{2}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}} - \frac{i q \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial z} \operatorname{Az}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right) W{\left(w \right)}}{2 m}\right)\, dw + \int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(W{\left(w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial t} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + W{\left(w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \frac{\partial}{\partial t} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right)\, dw = \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial W_{\rm proj}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial W_{\rm proj}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}\right) W{\left(W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{2 m} - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\left. \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \right|_{\substack{ w=- W_{\rm proj} }} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \left(\left. \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \right|_{\substack{ w=- W_{\rm proj} }} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}\right) W{\left(- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{2 m} + \int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right) \frac{d}{d w} W{\left(w \right)}}{2 m}\right)\, dw
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
8) Exact brane source term S_rho_brane (purely from J_w)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
\frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial W_{\rm proj}} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial W_{\rm proj}} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,W_{\rm proj} \right)}\right) W{\left(W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{2 m} - \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\left. \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \right|_{\substack{ w=- W_{\rm proj} }} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} + \left(\left. \frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \right|_{\substack{ w=- W_{\rm proj} }} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,- W_{\rm proj} \right)}\right) W{\left(- W_{\rm proj} \right)}}{2 m} + \int\limits_{- W_{\rm proj}}^{W_{\rm proj}} \left(- \frac{i \bar{\h} \left(- \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} + \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial w} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} - \frac{i q \operatorname{Aw}{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)} \psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}}{\bar{\h}}\right) \bar\psi{\left(t,x,y,z,w \right)}\right) \frac{d}{d w} W{\left(w \right)}}{2 m}\right)\, dw
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
8-note) Interpretation of S_rho_brane (no claims; just the identity)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
S_rho_brane is the *only* way the 3D brane density fails to be conserved.
It arises from bulk flow along w (J_w), through:
  (i) boundary flux at w=±Wproj, and
  (ii) the weight-gradient coupling ∫ (∂w Wt) J_w dw.
If the brane is effectively closed (J_w≈0 in the support of Wt), then S_rho_brane≈0.
If not, the brane is an open system (leakage) and mass can be injected/removed.
============================================================================================


============================================================================================
8b) Brane-observed velocity v_brane = J_brane / rho_brane
